        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 2015 Clemson Tigers football team, Alabama Crimson Tide football\n- Organizations: Clemson University, NCAA Division I FBS, College Football Playoff\n- Events: 2015 NCAA Division I FBS football season, 82nd Orange Bowl, 2015 Cotton Bowl, 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship\n- Places: University of Phoenix Stadium, Glendale, Arizona\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015 Clemson Tigers football team represented Clemson University in the 2015 NCAA Division I FBS football season.\n- The 82nd Orange Bowl was a College Football Playoff semifinal.\n- The winner of the 82nd Orange Bowl was scheduled to play the winner of the 2015 Cotton Bowl, identified here as Alabama Crimson Tide football, in the 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship.\n- The 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship took place at University of Phoenix Stadium in Glendale, Arizona.",
